				 What are Beginner Controls? 
 (Main Menu &amp;gt; Settings &amp;gt; Controls) 

Beginner controls are an excellent choice for players wanting a more casual experience or an easy way to jump in and play for the first time. 

This will completely remove the need for setting up the cab and instead allow you to focus on the driving experience. 

Beginner controls are enabled by default if you select Beginner/Casual on first launch.

